# NOTE: `ios/` is COMMITTED, not ignored. This block ignored it from when
# capacitor.config.ts was added and no platform existed yet — but a native
# project is not a build artifact: it carries the app icons, the bundle id, the
# version wiring and the signing config, and CI cannot build a release without
# it. Universal_PDF and Universal_AI track theirs for the same reason.
# Capacitor's own ios/.gitignore already excludes the genuinely generated parts
# (App/build, App/Pods, the copied web assets under App/App/public, and the
# generated App/App/capacitor.config.json).

# TypeScript incremental build artifacts
*.tsbuildinfo

# Per-user Claude Code settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Internal project notes — not published (matches the other Universal Apps repos)
CLAUDE.md

# Natural Earth source downloads for scripts/build-region-data.mjs (40 MB).
.cache/
